{"id":"00190","root":"uni00190_1","name":{"ja":"篠原　まり","en":"Shinohara Mari"},"title":{"ja":"【土遁対魔忍】","en":"【Earth Taimanin】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【土遁対魔忍】 篠原　まり","en":"【Earth Taimanin】 Shinohara Mari"},"element":"Natural","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-05-17","limited":true,"characterId":43,"profile":{"ja":"ふうまやゆきかぜとは別のクラスで委員長をしている。土遁の術使いにして、馬鹿力の持ち主。自身の拳と土遁の術を掛け合わせたスタイルで戦う。また彼女専用に用意された武器には試作兵器・巻物弾を装填することができるようになっている。巻物弾とは、一巻につき一つの技が封じられているもので、これを使用することで土遁以外の技も使うことが可能になった。笑顔が似合う明るい性格の持ち主だが、少しドジでおっちょこちょいなところも。高い能力を持っているにも関わらず、ドジをして失敗することもある。","en":"(Shinohara Mari, she/her) She serves as class president in a different class from Fuuma and Mizuki Yukikaze. A master of earth-style ninjutsu and possessing brute strength, she fights by combining her fists with earth techniques. The weapon prepared exclusively for her can be loaded with prototype ammunition called scroll bullets. Each scroll contains a single sealed technique, and using it allows her to employ abilities beyond earth style. She has a bright personality that suits her smile, though she can be a bit clumsy and prone to mishaps despite her high abilities."},"illustrator":"ぽ～しょん","voiceActor":"藤井ねここ","forms":[{"id":"uni00190_1","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1006,2012],"sp":[150,150],"atk":[142,284],"def":[109,218],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","190001"]},{"id":"uni00190_2","rarity":5,"rarityLabel":"UR","levelMax":90,"stats":{"hp":[1512,3024],"sp":[250,250],"atk":[219,438],"def":[153,306],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","190001","190002"]},{"id":"uni00190_3","rarity":6,"rarityLabel":"LR","levelMax":100,"stats":{"hp":[2018,4021],"sp":[330,330],"atk":[301,606],"def":[202,404],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,100]},"spCharge":40,"skills":["4","190001","190002","190003"]}],"skills":{"4":{"slot":"attack","id":4,"name":null,"hits":1,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"自然属性ダメー